; balance leaves out an account whose amounts all look zero at their display precision, unless
; -E. Y is written with one place, EUR with none, so an inferred -0.01506 Y or -0.008 EUR looks zero.
2026-01-01 style
    big       6.5 Y
    wallet    4 EUR
    sink

2026-01-02 inferred
    cheap     0.01004 X @ 1.5 Y
    quiet

2026-01-03 cost
    buy       0.004 X @ 2 EUR
    purse

2026-01-04 mixed
    cheap2    0.01004 X @ 1.5 Y
    src       5 W
    mixed
